  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.13.0 — EVM: a new signature replaces the earlier signatures from the same address that were not executed; they turn TxStatus.Cancelled (final status) and SignTransactionResponse.SupersededUuids lists them. New webhook event transaction.cancelled. New TransactionInfo.ErrorReason: why a transaction failed, expired or was cancelled, or why a signed one cannot be executed yet; TransactionInfo.Error is not sent by the API. New error codes: NONCE_GAP and NONCE_ALREADY_USED (execute), PREVIOUS_EXECUTE_UNRESOLVED (sign).",
